'''Freebuff''' is a free AI coding agent. You describe what you want in normal language and it works on a real project: it reads the code, changes files, runs the program, checks the result and reports back. The agent doing the work is called '''[[Buffy]]'''.

''Everything is on this page — just scroll. Words in yellow are links.''

